# General Rules

This document defines the general project standards and practices.

## Core Requirements

### Documentation

- **Documentation Location**: All project documentation is located in the `docs` folder
- **Documentation Structure**: Organize documentation by topic and audience
- **Keep Documentation Updated**: Update documentation when code changes affect functionality

### Files

- Use the settings in .editorconfig in the root of the project when generating files.
